abstract: >-
  A history-first educational handbook spanning computing, hardware,
  operating systems, programming, networking, frontend and backend
  engineering, databases, cloud, cybersecurity, data and AI, distributed
  systems, product design, global operations, trust and safety, testing,
  and a production architecture capstone. Prepared with AI assistance
  from ChatGPT (GPT-6).
